    <string name="welcome_to_olauncher_settings">Welcome to the settings!
        \n\nRemember, if you have any questions, our About page has the answer.</string>
    <string name="rate_us_message">Hi, you won\'t see this message again.
        \n\nIf you\'re finding Bullet Launcher useful, could you please leave a 5-star review? It\'ll mean the world to us. Thank you!</string>
    <string name="share_message">We need your help! We believe everyone should know about Bullet Launcher and its benefits, but we can\'t do it alone.
        \n\nCould you please share Bullet Launcher with your friends, family, and followers? Thank you for your support! ❤</string>
    <!--    <string name="share_message">Your monthly reminder - you should use your phone, not the other way round. Stay strong. You\'re doing great!-->
    <!--         \n\nIf you have a moment to spare, could you please share Olauncher with others? Olauncher needs people. More importantly, people need Olauncher.</string>-->
    <string name="keyboard_message">Hi, keyboard is the fastest way to find and launch apps in Bullet Launcher. Can we request you to keep this On for a few more days and then decide?
        \n\nThe choice is always yours.</string>
    <string name="digital_wellbeing_message">If you want to set time limits for certain apps, Digital Wellbeing feature of Android can help you do it.           Please search for Digital Wellbeing in your phone settings and enable it.</string>
    <string name="app_usage_message">To show/hide your screen time on the home screen, please allow or disallow the app usage permission.
        \n\nNote: No app usage data is collected. Everything is processed on your device.</string>
    <string name="pro_message">Bullet Launcher also has a pro version called Pro Launcher. It has extra features like weather, widgets, fonts, folders, AMOLED wallpapers, and so on.
        \n\nIt\'s also the best way to support the developers of Bullet Launcher. Check it out!</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_message">Bullet Launcher offers beautiful new wallpapers daily. Give your homescreen a fresh new look every day, for free!
        \n\nWant to try it?</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">The accessibility permission is required to enable the gesture - double tap to lock . Any data acquired by Bullet Launcher via this service will not leave your device.</string>
    <string name="support_olauncher_for_free">Support Bullet Launcher for free by using our Amazon affiliate link.</string>
    <string name="support_olauncher_message">Every time you buy something using our link, we get a small commission. Please save the link and use it whenever you shop online.\nThank you!</string>
